      "description": "The meme plays on the stereotype that Muslims are barbaric and violent, which is a common form of Islamophobia. The juxtaposition of the man's peaceful declaration with the threat to blow up the viewer plays on this stereotype, implying that his outward peacefulness is a facade for violent intent, a trope often used to delegitimize or fear Muslim individuals or groups.",
