      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "intended audience",
      "description": "The meme is designed for an audience familiar with or exposed to Islamophobic stereotypes, particularly those who associate Muslims with terrorism or violence. The target community likely includes individuals who hold or are influenced by prejudiced views toward Muslims, or who are seeking to reinforce such stereotypes through humor or satire. The meme’s effectiveness relies on the audience’s recognition of the visual cues (beard, green cap, protest setting) and the textual punchline as a reinforcement of harmful tropes. The audience is expected to interpret the man’s peaceful declaration as ironic or deceptive, thereby validating the stereotype that Muslims are inherently violent.",
